  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) Support to Crises Affected Population of Somali Region, Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project, IOM is providing lifesaving and life-sustaining water, sanitation and hygiene support to affected populations in Tuliguled woreda (Somali region) through provision of safe drinking water, construction of emergency latrine facilities, and hygiene promotion.</narrative>
  </description>
